# Set up {{PROVIDER}}

`scripts/setup.mjs` in this skill's directory applies the plugin's `stack.json` contract. Run the dry run first (`node "<this skill's directory>/scripts/setup.mjs" --target . --dry-run`), show every line to the user, ask, then run it without `--dry-run`.

